********************************************************************************
* In witchspace
* 
* Set by #R$894D when a hyperspace jump goes wrong ("Drive malfunction",
* a 12/256 chance) and the ship ends up in witchspace, halfway between
* the two systems ($EEC3/$EEC4). There, only Thargoids appear (#R$2B05);
* hyperspace can't be used until enough of them have been dealt with
* (#R$EEC2); the Torus Jump Drive doesn't work (#R$86E6); and there is no
* stardust (#R$68CD) or compass (#R$85FB).
in_witchspace:                                             ; >eec1
       byte >D4

